  "details": "Upon initially taking a picture to be saved to the gallery, the quality is perfectly fine. You can use the gallery picture for invites as expected in appropriate quality, but after a little bit of time (I have not yet determined how long) it seems all the images that are saved in the gallery are compressed MASSIVELY resulting in pictures that are just frankly useless. I get that VRC may be trying to save on storage space, but wow this is really low quality or bad compression. Look at how fuzzy and grainy this is as compared to the original.",
